OL,3,GEast                                   
OL,5,CToday:FA cold start across the region  
OL,6,Fwith the odd patch of freezing mist    
OL,7,Fand fog which is likely to linger. A   
OL,8,Ffine, dry but cold day follows, with   
OL,9,Fpatchy cloud developing but good sunny 
OL,10,Fspells likely. Light winds.            
OL,12,CTonight:FA partly cloudy and dry       
OL,13,Fevening and overnight with the risk of 
OL,14,Fpatchy mist and fog. Less cold than    
OL,15,FFriday night but a frost likely in     
OL,16,Fplaces. Winds freshen later.           
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
