OL,3,GEast                                   
OL,5,CSunday:FVariable cloud through the day 
OL,6,Fwith isolated light showers developing 
OL,7,Fmainly in the east. Temperatures near  
OL,8,Faverage with a reasonable breeze at    
OL,9,Ftimes.                                 
OL,11,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FPartly
OL,12,Fcloudy with isolated showers on        
OL,13,FMonday. Cloudier through Tuesday with  
OL,14,Fstrengthening winds but mostly dry.    
OL,15,FCloudy, breezy with rain possible on   
OL,16,FWednesday. Temperatures just below     
OL,17,Faverage.                               
